{"schema_version":2,"id":"p304-choke-under-pressure","revision":1,"title_en":"Why Do We “Choke” Under Pressure?","title_zh":"为什么我们在压力下会“发挥失常”？","level":"B1","primary_topic":"school","tags":["science","learning","psychology"],"source_type":"licensed_adaptation","fiction":false,"summary_zh":"面对重要考试或比赛时，许多人会体验到心跳加速、思维模糊和记忆受阻的“发挥失常”（choking under pressure）现象。心理学家通过工作记忆（working memory）解释了这一机制：工作记忆容量有限，当对成绩或时间的焦虑担忧侵占了宝贵的思维工作空间时，留给解题的认知资源就会减少。研究建议通过模拟实战演练、深呼吸调节以及考前将焦虑写在纸上等策略来释放工作记忆，认识到临场失常并非能力不足，而是压力下心理机制的反应。","featured":false,"admitted_at":"2026-11-21T12:30:00Z","paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"id":"s1","text":"Imagine sitting down to take an important exam.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"设想你正坐下来参加一场重要的考试。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":7,"surface":"Imagine","lemma":"imagine","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"设想"},{"start":8,"end":15,"surface":"sitting","lemma":"sit","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"坐"},{"start":16,"end":20,"surface":"down","lemma":"down","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"下"},{"start":21,"end":23,"surface":"to","lemma":"to","pos":"不定式标记","gloss_zh":"去"},{"start":24,"end":28,"surface":"take","lemma":"take","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"参加"},{"start":29,"end":31,"surface":"an","lemma":"an","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一场"},{"start":32,"end":41,"surface":"important","lemma":"important","pos":"形容词","gloss_zh":"重要的"},{"start":42,"end":46,"surface":"exam","lemma":"exam","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"考试"}],"phrases":[{"start":8,"end":20,"surface":"sitting down","gloss_zh":"坐下"}]},{"id":"s2","text":"You studied every night for a week and knew all the answers at home.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"你整整一周每晚都在用功，在家复习时所有答案都烂熟于心。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":3,"surface":"You","lemma":"you","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"你"},{"start":4,"end":11,"surface":"studied","lemma":"study","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"用功学习"},{"start":12,"end":17,"surface":"every","lemma":"every","pos":"限定词","gloss_zh":"每一个"},{"start":18,"end":23,"surface":"night","lemma":"night","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"夜晚"},{"start":24,"end":27,"surface":"for","lemma":"for","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"持续"},{"start":28,"end":29,"surface":"a","lemma":"a","pos":"冠词","gloss_zh":"一个"},{"start":30,"end":34,"surface":"week","lemma":"week","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"星期"},{"start":35,"end":38,"surface":"and","lemma":"and","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"而且"},{"start":39,"end":43,"surface":"knew","lemma":"know","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"知道"},{"start":44,"end":47,"surface":"all","lemma":"all","pos":"限定词","gloss_zh":"所有"},{"start":48,"end":51,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"定冠词","gloss_zh":"这些"},{"start":52,"end":59,"surface":"answers","lemma":"answer","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"答案"},{"start":60,"end":62,"surface":"at","lemma":"at","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"在"},{"start":63,"end":67,"surface":"home","lemma":"home","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"家里"}],"phrases":[{"start":60,"end":67,"surface":"at home","gloss_zh":"在家里"}]},{"id":"s3","text":"But as soon as you look at the test paper, your heart begins to race.","separator_after":" ","translation_zh":"但你一看到试卷，心跳就开始加速狂跳。","tokens":[{"start":0,"end":3,"surface":"But","lemma":"but","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"但是"},{"start":4,"end":6,"surface":"as","lemma":"as","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"一……"},{"start":7,"end":11,"surface":"soon","lemma":"soon","pos":"副词","gloss_zh":"就……"},{"start":12,"end":14,"surface":"as","lemma":"as","pos":"连词","gloss_zh":"当……时"},{"start":15,"end":18,"surface":"you","lemma":"you","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"你"},{"start":19,"end":23,"surface":"look","lemma":"look","pos":"动词","gloss_zh":"看"},{"start":24,"end":26,"surface":"at","lemma":"at","pos":"介词","gloss_zh":"向"},{"start":27,"end":30,"surface":"the","lemma":"the","pos":"定冠词","gloss_zh":"这"},{"start":31,"end":35,"surface":"test","lemma":"test","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"测试"},{"start":36,"end":41,"surface":"paper","lemma":"paper","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"试卷"},{"start":43,"end":47,"surface":"your","lemma":"your","pos":"代词","gloss_zh":"你的"},{"start":48,"end":53,"surface":"heart","lemma":"heart","pos":"名词","gloss_zh":"心跳"},{"start":54,"end":60,"surface":"begins","lemma":"begin",